        "content": "NAME: [System] Connectivity Check\nPURPOSE: Verifies that all 6 external services are reachable. Each node is independently green/red — failures are visible at a glance in n8n execution view.\nTRIGGER: Manual or daily scheduled run.\nCREDENTIALS USED: Telnyx API Key, Airtable API Key, Instantly Bearer (fetched from /api/credentials).\nSERVICES CHECKED: FastAPI health, Telnyx API, Airtable API, Instantly API, Shipday API, Google Drive.",
